Dear Iona,

Thank you for the update on the entrance door at 14 Lantern Mews. I am glad it has latched on each use, and I have noted that it still needs a firm pull. Please keep telling us if that changes, or if it stops latching.

You asked whether painting would affect the door. The only painting quotation we have covers sanding and repainting the flat-side face and visible top edge. It does not cover the door catching, and it does not include any adjustment of the door or hinges. The contractor's visit was visual only, so we do not yet know why the door catches. I cannot say whether painting would change how it closes. The landlord has not yet decided whether to approve painting, a further inspection, or both, and nothing is booked.

On notice: no one will be sent without the landlord's approval. If further access is approved, I will ask the contractor to arrange it with you in advance, after 10:30 as you requested, and without photographing personal items. I will keep you updated.

Kind regards,
